# auto-ammo-heavy: as setup/auto-ammo (10 sling stones in the pack, the player at (36, 7) on level
# 1 with 5 more at their feet), then strength 10, so the player can carry 200 (tenths of a stone,
# strength * 20), and the weight carried set to 200: all they can carry, so the 5 stones at their
# feet are too heavy to take. Saved in slot I, described "ammo"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat give 0x10 10
44200 cheat goto 1 36 7
45500 cheat give 0x10 5 drop
45700 cheat set str 10
45900 cheat set weight 200
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "ammo"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key a
50700 key m
50900 key m
51100 key o
52000 key enter
